[h1]白绮 Vivhite — 独立角色 Mod[/h1]

白绮是一位精通数学、计算机与艺术的魔法少女。她以生命作为魔法演算材料，通过“謦欬施法 → 击杀或汲取回血 → 继续施法”建立战斗循环。

[b]当前版本：[/b] 0.2.2
[b]适配游戏：[/b] Slay the Spire 2 v0.111.0
[b]实机验证分支：[/b] Steam [code]public-beta[/code]（当前公开材料仅覆盖此分支）
[b]语言：[/b] 简体中文 / English
[b]必须依赖：[/b] [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3747602295]RitsuLib 0.5.14[/url]

[h2]内容[/h2]
[list]
[*] 独立可玩角色白绮，78 点初始最大生命、99 金币、每回合 3 能量。
[*] 61 张专属卡牌：3 基础、18 普通、24 罕见、16 稀有。
[*] 三套主要构筑：守恒几何、递归星算、绯彩积分，以及跨体系组合牌。
[*] 初始遗物“孤高冠冕”：任意敌人死亡时回复最大生命的 20%，向上取整。
[*] 完整中英文本地化、专属卡图、Power、能量 UI、角色动画与视觉特效。
[*] 玩法不设置自定义成长硬上限；保留游戏本身的自然规则。
[/list]

[h2]安装[/h2]
[list=1]
[*] 先订阅上方 RitsuLib 依赖。
[*] 订阅本条目并等待 Steam 下载完成。
[*] 推荐使用已经过实机验证的 Vulkan 启动游戏；Steam 启动项设置为：[code]%command% --rendering-driver vulkan[/code]
[*] 在 Mod 菜单启用 RitsuLib 与 Vivhite 后重启游戏。
[/list]

游戏另提供 OpenGL3（[code]--rendering-driver opengl3[/code]）和 D3D12 入口；本 Mod 尚未完成
这两个后端的专项验收。若 Vulkan 无法启动，可以将 OpenGL3 作为游戏级排障尝试，但不代表
本 Mod 已兼容。遇到加载失败，请附上实际渲染后端和
[code]%APPDATA%\SlayTheSpire2\logs\godot.log[/code] 反馈。

[h2]更新日志 / Changelog[/h2]
[h3]0.2.2（2026-09-05）[/h3]
[list]
[*] 修复“色彩守恒”的升级：謦欬生命消耗现在会从 4 降至 2，不再出现升级后没有数值变化。
[*] 修复“无限画布”的升级：能量费用现在会从 3 降至 2，同时继续切换为升级版汲取成长效果。
[*] 新增全部 61 张卡牌的升级验收，并回归覆盖钨合金棍、Buffer 的生命支付与“事件循环”临时复制语义。
[*] 继续适配 Steam [code]public-beta[/code] / Slay the Spire 2 v0.111.0，并使用 Vulkan 完成发布构建验收；OpenGL3 与 D3D12 尚未完成 Mod 专项兼容验收。
[/list]

[h1]English[/h1]

Vivhite is an independent magical-girl character built around mathematics, computation, and art. Her combat loop spends HP through Cough, then recovers through kills or Drain to continue casting.

[b]Version:[/b] 0.2.2
[b]Target game:[/b] Slay the Spire 2 v0.111.0
[b]In-game verification branch:[/b] Steam [code]public-beta[/code] (the current public material covers this branch only)
[b]Languages:[/b] Simplified Chinese / English
[b]Required dependency:[/b] [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3747602295]RitsuLib 0.5.14[/url]

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*] A fully independent playable character with 78 starting Max HP, 99 Gold, and 3 Energy per turn.
[*] 61 dedicated cards: 3 basic, 18 common, 24 uncommon, and 16 rare.
[*] Three main archetypes: Conservation Geometry, Recursive Star Calculus, and Crimson Integral, plus cross-archetype cards.
[*] Starting relic Solitary Crown: whenever any enemy dies, heal 20% of Max HP, rounded up.
[*] Complete Chinese and English localization, bespoke card art, Powers, energy UI, character animation, and VFX.
[*] No custom hard caps on Vivhite's scaling; normal game invariants still apply.
[/list]

[h2]Install[/h2]
[list=1]
[*] Subscribe to RitsuLib using the dependency link above.
[*] Subscribe to this item and let Steam finish downloading it.
[*] Prefer the Vulkan path validated in-game: [code]%command% --rendering-driver vulkan[/code].
[*] Enable both RitsuLib and Vivhite in the Mod menu, then restart the game.
[/list]

The game also ships OpenGL3 (`--rendering-driver opengl3`) and D3D12 launchers, but this Mod
has not completed backend-specific acceptance for either renderer. If Vulkan does not start,
OpenGL3 may be tried as a game-level troubleshooting fallback; that does not mean the Mod is
compatible. Include the actual renderer and `%APPDATA%\SlayTheSpire2\logs\godot.log` when reporting
load failures.

Source code and issue tracker: [url=https://github.com/XenoAmess/slay-the-spire-vivhite-mod]GitHub[/url]
License: GNU GPL v3

[h2]Changelog / 更新日志[/h2]
[h3]0.2.2 (2026-09-05)[/h3]
[list]
[*] Fixed Color Conservation's upgrade: its Cough HP cost now decreases from 4 to 2 instead of receiving no numerical upgrade.
[*] Fixed Infinite Canvas's upgrade: its Energy cost now decreases from 3 to 2 while it still switches to the upgraded Drain-growth effect.
[*] Added upgrade acceptance for all 61 cards, including regressions for Tungsten Rod/Buffer HP payment and Event Loop's temporary-copy semantics.
[*] Continued support for Steam [code]public-beta[/code] / Slay the Spire 2 v0.111.0 with the release build accepted on Vulkan; OpenGL3 and D3D12 still lack Mod-specific compatibility acceptance.
[/list]
